{"path": "parts/a2_05.js", "content": "{
emoji:'🖌️',title:'The Magic Paintbrush',start:'s1',
segs:{
 s1:{text:`Leo loved to draw. He drew every day. He drew animals, people, houses, and trees. His drawings were good. But Leo wanted to draw better. He wanted his drawings to be alive. "If my drawings could move," he thought, "that would be amazing." One day, Leo was walking in the park. He saw an old man sitting on a bench. The old man had a small box. In the box, there was a paintbrush. It was old and simple. But it looked special. "Hello, boy," said the old man. "Do you like to draw?" "Yes, I do!" said Leo. The old man smiled. "Take this paintbrush," he said. "It is a gift. Use it well." Leo took the paintbrush. "Thank you!" he said. The old man smiled and walked away. Leo looked at the paintbrush. It was just a paintbrush. But Leo felt that it was special. He went home. He wanted to try it.`, choices:[{t:'Нарисовать своего кота',n:'s2'},{t:'Нарисовать цветок',n:'s3'}]},
 s2:{text:`Leo had a cat named Tom. Tom was a big, orange cat. Leo decided to draw Tom. He took the magic paintbrush. He dipped it in yellow paint. He drew Tom's body. Then he drew Tom's head. He drew Tom's ears. He drew Tom's tail. He drew Tom's eyes. When he finished, he looked at the drawing. It was good. But then, something amazing happened. The drawing moved! Tom in the drawing blinked. Then he meowed. Then he jumped out of the paper! He was a real cat! Leo could not believe his eyes. "Tom!" he shouted. "You are alive!" The new Tom looked at Leo. He meowed. He was exactly like the real Tom. Leo was happy. But then he thought. "Wait," he said. "Now I have two cats!" The real Tom came into the room. He saw the new Tom. He hissed. The new Tom hissed back. They started to fight! Leo did not know what to do. "Stop! Stop!" he shouted. But the cats did not stop. Leo had an idea. He took the paintbrush. He drew a big dog. The dog jumped out of the paper. It barked loudly. The cats got scared and ran away. Leo laughed. The magic paintbrush was very powerful.`, choices:[{t:'Нарисовать что-нибудь ещё',n:'s4'},{t:'Попробовать нарисовать что-то другое',n:'s5'}]},
 s3:{text:`Leo decided to draw a flower. He took the magic paintbrush. He dipped it in red paint. He drew a beautiful red flower. When he finished, the flower moved. It grew. It became a real flower! It was big and beautiful. It smelled nice. Leo was amazed. "It is a real flower!" he said. He touched it. The petals were soft. Leo was happy. He drew more flowers. He drew yellow flowers, blue flowers, and purple flowers. Soon, his room was full of flowers. They were all real. They were beautiful. Leo smiled. "This is wonderful!" he said. But then he thought. "If I can draw flowers, I can draw anything. I can help people with this." He wanted to use the magic paintbrush to do good things. He decided to draw food for hungry people. He drew bread, fruit, and vegetables. They became real. He gave them to people in need. The people were happy. Leo was happy too. He felt good. He was using the magic paintbrush to help others.`, choices:[{t:'Продолжать помогать людям',n:'s6'}]},
"}
